@def MICRO_OS_PLUS_MICRO_TEST_PLUS_ENABLED
@brief Enables the µTest++ Testing Framework.

@details
This is the main configuration option of this library; it has no value,
only its definition matters.

Without it, `micro-os-plus/micro-test-plus.h` declares nothing and the
library sources compile to nothing. If it is defined on the compiler
command line for the application, but not for the library sources, the
link fails with undefined references.
